---
const repo = 'https://github.com/mhermon/sec-fid';
const paper = 'https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.30783';
---

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="masthead" aria-label="Primary navigation">
      <div class="masthead-links">
        <a href="#benchmark">Benchmark</a>
        <a href="#frontier">Results</a>
        <a href="#use">Run</a>
        <a href="#cite">Cite</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Security-Fidelity Tradeoffs</p>
      <h1><span>The hidden cost of</span> <span>prompt injection defense</span></h1>
      <div class="hero-body">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="lede">
            Security-only benchmarks cannot tell faithful processing from silent
            data loss. SecFid measures both and reveals the tradeoff across models
            and defenses.
          </p>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a class="btn primary" href={paper}>Read the paper</a>
            <a class="btn" href={repo}>Repository</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="authors">
          Mitchell&nbsp;Hermon<sup>1</sup>, Rahul&nbsp;Gupta<sup>2</sup>,
          Weitong&nbsp;Ruan<sup>2</sup>, Ekraam&nbsp;Sabir<sup>2</sup>,
          Haohan&nbsp;Wang<sup>1</sup><br />
          <span class="affil"><sup>1</sup> University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign &nbsp;&nbsp;<sup>2</sup> Amazon</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="stats" role="list">
      <li><b>1,168</b><span>separable instances</span></li>
      <li><b>4</b><span>tasks across 2 families</span></li>
      <li><b>48</b><span>evaluated configurations</span></li>
      <li><b>252</b><span>agentic scenarios</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero { padding-block: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem); }

  .masthead {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-bottom: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }
  .masthead-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: clamp(0.8rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--type-caption);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .masthead-links a { color: var(--ink-soft); text-decoration: none; }

  .hero-intro { margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--type-label);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-kicker);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-optical-sizing: auto;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 120;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.4vw, 4.35rem);
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  @media (min-width: 52rem) {
    h1 span { display: block; white-space: nowrap; }
  }
  .hero-body {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    align-items: end;
    margin-top: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
  }
  @media (min-width: 62rem) {
    .hero-body { grid-template-columns: minmax(28rem, 1.1fr) minmax(20rem, 0.9fr); }
    .hero-body .authors { text-align: right; }
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.6vw, 1.18rem);
    line-height: 1.58;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .authors { font-size: var(--type-small); line-height: var(--leading-compact); }
  .authors .affil { color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: var(--type-caption); }
  sup { font-size: 0.65em; color: var(--ink-faint); }

  .stats {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .stats li { padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.15rem; }
  .stats li:first-child { border-left: none; }
  .stats b { font-family: var(--font-display); font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 60; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.9rem; line-height: 1; font-variant-numeric: lining-nums tabular-nums; }
  .stats span { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--type-caption); color: var(--ink-soft); }

  @media (max-width: 42rem) {
    .masthead-links {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      font-size: var(--type-caption);
    }
    .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .stats li:nth-child(3) { border-left: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .stats li:nth-child(4) { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  }
</style>
